      "writtenOn": "2024-09-23T05:39:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The autogenerated code is based on GPU generations, in https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/gpu_info.json;l\u003d193, the `Gen 12 LP` is integrated GPUs which includes Gen12 GPUs and Gen12.7 GPUs, the \"Gen 12 HP\" is discrete GPUs which includes Gen12.1 GPUs and Gen12.7 GPUs.\n\nThis issue is reproduced on 12.7 iGPUs and dGPUs, we cannot enable workaround using the generation, and it\u0027s difficult to compare the generation with dot if we add Gen12.7.",
      "parentUuid": "cbae6b09_42c37139",
      "revId": "ea4e0fe7947d8fb0c33dc916a2d9ba17a72b9bcf",
